OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABoy said Allahu Akbar in school
OL,4,Aattack, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old boy shouted "Allahu
OL,7,FAkbar" as he filmed himself stabbing
OL,8,Ftwo children at school then declared:
OL,9,F"I'm not a kid any more, I'm a
OL,10,Fsoldier," a court has heard.
OL,12,FThe defendant, who cannot be named for
OL,13,Flegal reasons, used a mobile phone to
OL,14,Frecord the attack at Kingsbury High
OL,15,FSchool in Brent, north-west London, on
OL,16,F10 February, the Old Bailey was told.
