OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABoy said Allahu Akbar in school
OL,4,Aattack, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe now 14-year-old allegedly stabbed
OL,7,Fone boy in a classroom before stabbing
OL,8,Fa second boy in the playground. As he
OL,9,Fran away, he was recorded on his phone
OL,10,Fsaying he wanted to be a "martyr", the
OL,11,FOld Bailey was told.
OL,13,FThe prosecution case is that the
OL,14,Fteenager attempted to murder the two
OL,15,Fboys "as an act of terrorism". He
OL,16,Fdenies attempted murder.
